  message: "TRUE DUPLICATE of WI-nabaz, and the fault is mine, not the SimHash warning being wrong. WI-nabaz was created successfully on the first valid filing run; its ID was cut off by a `tail -3` on the command output, so I read the run as having failed and filed the same item again. The SimHash near-duplicate warning fired on the second filing and was correct. Closing this one as wont_do rather than deleting: tracker delete requires human authority (it refused me), and leaving the duplicate visible with its cause recorded is the honest resolution. Work the item on WI-nabaz."  # 0d29
